### Test Case: Verify updating product without sending images preserves existing variant images

# Step 1: Create a product with variants that have images
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "{{vendorId}}",
  "name": "Test Product - Preserve Images",
  "shortDescription": "Test product for image preservation",
  "description": "Testing that variant images are preserved when updating product without images",
  "categories": [],
  "tags": ["test"],
  "variants": [
    {
      "title": "Red / M",
      "attributes": { "size": "M", "color": "red" },
      "price": 1999,
      "mrp": 2499,
      "stock": 15
    }
  ]
}

### Step 2: Add images to the variant (use the product ID from step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/variants/VARIANT_SKU_HERE/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Upload some test images here

### Step 3: Get product to verify images exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 4: Update product WITHOUT sending any image-related fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product - Preserve Images UPDATED",
  "shortDescription": "Updated description",
  "tags": ["test", "updated"]
}

### Step 5: Get product again to verify variant images are still preserved
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 6: Test with variants in request body (but no images) - should still preserve existing images
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product - Preserve Images UPDATED AGAIN",
  "shortDescription": "Updated again",
  "tags": ["test", "updated", "again"],
  "variants": [
    {
      "title": "Red / M",
      "attributes": { "size": "M", "color": "red" },
      "price": 2199,
      "mrp": 2699,
      "stock": 20
    }
  ]
}

### Step 7: Final check - variant images should STILL be preserved
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
